## Scope of Software License

This dual license covers the ONE Language software source code within this repository, including:
- Core compiler, parser, AST emitter, type checker, and intermediate representation (IR) lowering;
- Virtual Machine (UnifiedVM), native runtime, and standard library modules;
- Developer CLI toolchain (`bin/one.cjs`, `OneDeveloperCLI.ts`) and build/packaging scripts;
- VS Code editor extension and Language Server (LSP);
- Core modular packages (`packages/*`);
- Executable packer (`ExecutablePacker.ts`, `ExecutableLoader.ts`, `*.ox` artifact format);
- Official test suites and documentation.

## Excluded Assets

This software license does NOT apply to:
- External neural network weights, model parameters, and checkpoints (including `one_lm_best.cubiomodel`), which reside outside this repository;
- Model training datasets, corpus data, and private benchmark inputs;
- External repositories and data volumes (including `F:\3D memory studio\ONE language` and `E:\ONE_language_baseline`).

